132
00:05:35,709 --> 00:05:38,290
into a volume by price data structure

133
00:05:38,290 --> 00:05:40,430
and that takes computing resources.

134
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:41,529
On top of that,

135
00:05:41,529 --> 00:05:43,610
