139
00:05:52,170 --> 00:05:54,370
to produce volume profiles.

140
00:05:54,370 --> 00:05:56,689
So we could just be like most people, you know,

141
00:05:56,689 --> 00:05:58,850
and trade it anyways without testing it,

142
