250
00:10:07,929 --> 00:10:11,570
The existence of patterns or statistical abnormalities

251
00:10:11,570 --> 00:10:14,970
doesn't necessarily mean they're predictive.

252
00:10:14,970 --> 00:10:18,169
They're really more the result than the cause of things.

253
00:10:18,169 --> 00:10:20,830
And so we're assigning significance to levels

254
00:10:20,830 --> 00:10:23,570
that are really just arbitrary and random.

255
00:10:23,570 --> 00:10:26,370
I've always found it particularly amusing

256
00:10:26,370 --> 00:10:30,769
